{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00753","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享文敬太子庙乐章 送神 · 张荐","name":"郊庙歌辞 享文敬太子庙乐章 送神","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三献具举，九旗将旋。\n追劳表德，罢享宾天。\n风引仙管，堂虚画筵。\n芳馨常在，瞻望悠然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张荐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00753.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00753","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}